gnr(){return"This text may have been processed by a paraphrasing tool (e.g. QuillBot, Undetectable.ai) to evade detection. Even if it reads naturally sentence-by-sentence, its overall statistical fingerprint still differs from genuine human writing \u2014 please pay extra attention."},
